<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσδόκ-ῐμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>expected, looked for</i>,
			or <i>to be expected</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὁ θάνατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prog.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσι παρεοῦσί τε καὶ π. κακοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> freq. of
			persons, <i>expected</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατὸν π. εἶναι Κροίσῳ ἐπὶ τὴν
					χώρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.78
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐς τὴν Κύπρον, ἐπὶ Μίλητον
				π</span>., <i>expected to come</i> to Cyprus, against
			Miletus, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ πόδας ἐμεῦ ἐλαύνων π. ἐστι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.89
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ βαρβάρου π. ὄντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ Πελοποννήσου ἄλλη στρατιὰ π.
					αὐτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				6.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἥξειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.64
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>
			<u>Gloss.</u>
        </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
